WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.023 --> 00:00:02.110
- I was just told we have footage.

00:00:02.110 --> 00:00:03.640
We have video of Donnie Wahlberg

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:06.620
and his brother Mark
serenading the family dog

00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:07.453
when they were little.

00:00:07.453 --> 00:00:08.286
So I want to see this.

00:00:08.286 --> 00:00:09.823
Let's see this.

00:00:09.823 --> 00:00:10.656
(Rick Astley's "Never Gonna Give You Up")

00:00:10.656 --> 00:00:12.533
♪ Never gonna give you up ♪

00:00:12.533 --> 00:00:14.624
♪ Never gonna let you down ♪

00:00:14.624 --> 00:00:18.868
♪ Never gonna run around and desert you ♪

00:00:18.868 --> 00:00:19.835
(cheering)

00:00:19.835 --> 00:00:21.317
That's right!

00:00:21.317 --> 00:00:22.601
That's right, y'all!

00:00:22.601 --> 00:00:25.673
Please welcome the man who's
rolled his way into our lives

00:00:25.673 --> 00:00:27.420
when we least expected it,

00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:30.903
and he's also part of the
Mixtape Tour 2022, Rick Astley!

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:33.438
(smooth jazz intro plays)

00:00:33.438 --> 00:00:36.188
(crowd cheering)

00:00:38.109 --> 00:00:41.840
Oh my gosh, welcome to the show, Rick.

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:43.490
Is it true?

00:00:43.490 --> 00:00:46.670
Your look in that video was a total fluke?

00:00:46.670 --> 00:00:49.720
- Yeah. It's a total mess
is what it is, to be honest.

00:00:49.720 --> 00:00:51.440
I mean, it wasn't styled in any way.

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:53.290
All those clothes are my own clothes.

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:56.810
I mean, look at the
raincoat, come on, man.

00:00:56.810 --> 00:01:00.340
It's the middle of July when
we filmed that video, I think.

00:01:00.340 --> 00:01:02.460
It makes me sweat actually,
looking at that video,

00:01:02.460 --> 00:01:04.000
it actually makes me sweat.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:05.350
It brings back great memories

00:01:05.350 --> 00:01:08.345
and it brings back
terrifying memories as well.

00:01:08.345 --> 00:01:09.630
- I thought it was iconic.

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:11.030
Everyone knows it and loves it.

00:01:11.030 --> 00:01:15.140
But here is a guy who took
Rickrolling to another level.

00:01:15.140 --> 00:01:18.453
Watch this.

00:01:18.453 --> 00:01:20.180
This is amazing.

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:23.756
That's a QR code. And
when you scan it, well.

00:01:23.756 --> 00:01:25.485
("Never Gonna Give You Up" plays)

00:01:25.485 --> 00:01:27.818
(laughter)

00:01:30.540 --> 00:01:34.154
- What a way to be a part
of pop culture forever.

00:01:34.154 --> 00:01:36.813
So, do you have a favorite Rickroll?

00:01:37.880 --> 00:01:38.713
- Favorite Rickroll?

00:01:38.713 --> 00:01:41.060
I mean, so many people have
done so many crazy things

00:01:41.060 --> 00:01:42.150
with that thing.

00:01:42.150 --> 00:01:45.480
My ultimate ultimate favorite I think is,

00:01:45.480 --> 00:01:48.720
I was told that the White
House was Rickrolled,

00:01:48.720 --> 00:01:51.220
everybody on staff and Obama
was the president at the time,

00:01:51.220 --> 00:01:53.310
so even he got Rickrolled
that day in an email

00:01:53.310 --> 00:01:56.020
that everybody got, so I kinda
thought that was amazing,

00:01:56.020 --> 00:01:58.950
but I mean, there's just been
some crazy ones over the time,

00:01:58.950 --> 00:01:59.783
to be honest.

00:01:59.783 --> 00:02:02.615
It's the song that keeps giving
that's the way I look at it.

00:02:02.615 --> 00:02:04.276
(clapping)

00:02:04.276 --> 00:02:06.658
- Oh yeah, you write that great
of a song it's gonna happen.

00:02:06.658 --> 00:02:10.060
Did you see Ted-- Do you watch Ted Lasso?

00:02:10.060 --> 00:02:11.945
- Of course. I'm a massive fan, huge fan.

00:02:11.945 --> 00:02:13.320
- Oh my gosh. I love it.

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:15.650
And they use your song
there too, that's amazing.

00:02:15.650 --> 00:02:18.470
I just didn't know if
you saw that episode.

00:02:18.470 --> 00:02:20.560
- No, it's just unbelievable.

00:02:20.560 --> 00:02:23.470
And Hannah Waddingham,
who sang the tune as well,

00:02:23.470 --> 00:02:24.810
she's a great, great singer

00:02:24.810 --> 00:02:27.670
and it kinda brought a tear
to my eye to be honest,

00:02:27.670 --> 00:02:28.810
because like I say,

00:02:28.810 --> 00:02:31.040
a lot of people have done
some fun things with that,

00:02:31.040 --> 00:02:32.853
they've even tattooed themselves,

00:02:34.670 --> 00:02:37.410
but I think to see somebody do
it so emotionally that song,

00:02:37.410 --> 00:02:38.650
you know what I mean, and
kinda turn it on its head.

00:02:38.650 --> 00:02:40.470
It's just incredible. So yeah.

00:02:40.470 --> 00:02:42.790
- Oh man, Hannah was just on the show

00:02:42.790 --> 00:02:44.130
and I'm a fan for life.

00:02:44.130 --> 00:02:45.340
I loved her from Ted Lasso,

00:02:45.340 --> 00:02:48.153
but in person she's even just
more of a joy. I love her.

